pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Aquatic sewing machine.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d4/Aquatic_sewing_machine..png/revision/latest?cb=20210212034420\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Aquatic sewing machine.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d4/Aquatic_sewing_machine..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210212034420\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d4/Aquatic_sewing_machine..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210212034420 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d4/Aquatic_sewing_machine..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210212034420 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Aquatic sewing machine.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Aquatic_sewing_machine..png\" data-image-name=\"Aquatic sewing machine..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_8\" title=\"Series 8\">8</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Paul_Sinha\" title=\"Paul Sinha\">Paul Sinha</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/This_is_Trevor.\" title=\"This is Trevor.\">This is Trevor.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/I%27ve_been_a_bit_ill.\" title=\"I&#39;ve been a bit ill.\">I've been a bit ill.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Aquatic sewing machine.</b></i> is the eighth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_8\" title=\"Series 8\">Series 8</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 26 June 2019. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Paul_Sinha\" title=\"Paul Sinha\">Paul Sinha</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Aquatic_sewing_machine.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Aquatic sewing machine\" was a phrase used by <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> to describe how a horny male dolphin might go at him, if he was to take <a href=\"/wiki/Lou_Sanders\" title=\"Lou Sanders\">Lou Sanders</a>' prize in the <a href=\"/wiki/Nicest_thing_to_hold\" title=\"Nicest thing to hold\">Nicest thing to hold</a> task. It was the only episode named after a quote from the episode's prize task all the way until <a href=\"/wiki/Series_21\" title=\"Series 21\">Series 21</a>'s <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lou_Reed_and_The_Wombles.\" title=\"Lou Reed and The Wombles.\">Lou Reed and The Wombles.</a></span>. The title card depicts \"<a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">TM</a>\" written in sand, referencing the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_best_picture_in_the_sand_of_a_former_Taskmaster_contestant\" title=\"Make the best picture in the sand of a former Taskmaster contestant\">Make the best picture in the sand of a former Taskmaster contestant</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Aquatic_sewing_machine.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Vandsymaskine', which translates as 'Aquatic sewing machine'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Vedenalainen ompelukone', which translates as 'Underwater sewing machine'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Undervannsymaskin', which translates as 'Underwater sewing machine'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Aquatic_sewing_machine.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Iain_Stirling\" title=\"Iain Stirling\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Iain Stirling</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Thomas\" title=\"Joe Thomas\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Joe Thomas</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Lou_Sanders\" title=\"Lou Sanders\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Lou Sanders</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Paul_Sinha\" title=\"Paul Sinha\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Paul Sinha</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sian_Gibson\" title=\"Sian Gibson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sian Gibson</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nicest_thing_to_hold\" title=\"Nicest thing to hold\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Nicest thing to hold.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_best_picture_in_the_sand_of_a_former_Taskmaster_contestant\" title=\"Make the best picture in the sand of a former Taskmaster contestant\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the best picture in the sand of a former Taskmaster contestant using one of these implements. You must roll the dice to choose your implement. Nothing but air may touch the sand at any point.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Catch_all_the_red_balls,_catch_all_the_yellow_balls,_catch_the_blue_ball\" title=\"Catch all the red balls, catch all the yellow balls, catch the blue ball\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Catch all the red balls in things from the shed. Catch all the yellow balls in clothing. Don't let the green balls touch anything other than the grass. Catch the blue ball in something from the kitchen. You may not touch the ball machines. Any non-green ball that touches the ground at any point will not count.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_this_beach_ball_cross_the_finishing_line\" title=\"Make this beach ball cross the finishing line\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make this beach ball cross the finishing line. Only water can touch the beach ball.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ScoresS8&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ScoresS8-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ScoresS8&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ScoresS8-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Complete_the_five-syllable_word_started_by_the_Taskmaster\" title=\"Complete the five-syllable word started by the Taskmaster\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Complete the five-syllable word started by the Taskmaster. Honk your horn if you think you know what word the Taskmaster is going to say. If you guess it correctly after one syllable, you get five points. If you guess it after two syllables - four points etc. Guess it incorrectly, you lose all your points. You may only guess once per word.\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>18\n</td>\n<td>7\n</td>\n<td>12<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ScoresS8&#95;1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ScoresS8-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">21\n</td>\n<td>8<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ScoresS8&#95;1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ScoresS8-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Notes</b>\n</p>\n<div class=\"references-small\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-ScoresS8-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-ScoresS8_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-ScoresS8_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-ScoresS8_1-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-ScoresS8_1-3\">1.3</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Whilst Lou completed the task in 5:37 and Sian completed it in 6:40, Sian was awarded 4 points and Lou awarded 3 points, although Lou should have been awarded 4 points and Sian 3 points.The scores for the episode and total points for the series both reflect this unexplained change to the points said to be awarded for this task.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Aquatic_sewing_machine.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li